  "solution": "__**BODMAS RULE:**__\n\n [IMAGE: https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Iv_Yloxc5YuOToqGhWLwhteeazqKK5CGJR2BlGwuwgJxnNBi2uT5Rgf_2fVYsGmeH9IZ6PPzC7doufV7lizNzCzSpczUnyNbDDtckVStGGwtQ2p1SgpKb6Vfr5KT-bEtoFOIQeUA] \n\n**Option (1): -, ×, +, ÷, + **\n\n46 - 12 × 32 + 8 ÷ (96 + 23) = 437 \n\nAfter put sign in given equation: 46 - 12 × 32 + 8 ÷ __**(96 + 23)**__ = 437\n\n→ 46 - 12 × 32 +__** 8 ÷ 119**__ = 437\n\n→ 46 - __**12 × 32**__ + 0.067 = 437\n\n→ __**46 **__- 384 __**+ 0.067**__ = 437\n\n→ **__46.067 - 384__**\n\n→ - 337.933 ≠ 437\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (2): ÷, -, ×, +, -**\n\nAfter put sign in given equation: 46 ÷ 12 - 32 × 8 + **__(96 - 23)__** = 437\n\n→ **__46 ÷ 12 __**- 32 × 8 + 73 = 437\n\n→ 3.833 - **__32 × 8__** + 73 = 437\n\n→ **__3.833 __**- 256 __**+ 73 **__= 437\n\n→ **__76.833 - 256__**\n\n→ - 179.167 ≠ 437\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (3): +, ×, -, ÷, -**\n\nAfter put sign in given equation: 46 + 12 × 32 - 8 ÷ **__(96 - 23)__** = 437\n\n→ 46 + 12 × 32 - **__8 ÷ 73__** = 437\n\n→ 46 + __**12 × 32**__ - 0.1095 = 437\n\n→ __**46 + 384**__ - 0.1095 = 437\n\n→ __**430 - 0.1095**__ = 437\n\n→ 429.8905 ≠ 437\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (4): ×, +, ÷, -, +**\n\nAfter put sign in given equation: 46 × 12 + 32 ÷ 8 - __**(96 + 23)**__ = 437\n\n→ 46 × 12 + **__32 ÷ 8__** - 119 = 437\n\n→ __**46 × 12**__ + 4 - 119 = 437\n\n→ __**552 + 4**__ - 119 = 437\n\n→ __**556 - 119**__ = 437\n\n→ 437 = 437 \n\n→ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\".**",
